    "title_en": "Instability of Riemannian Schwarzschild-Tangherlini metrics",
    "abstract_en": "We recall a conformal method, suggested in a previous work, for testing the stability of Einstein metrics. We then give a direct application of this method when the manifold is conformal to a Riemannian (multi-)product. Finally, we apply the procedure to the Riemannian Schwarzschild-Tangherlini metric, which turns out to be unstable in dimensions $n\\in \\{4,\\cdots ,9\\}$.",
